!La Vaule S Header.jpg||
=4 Walkthrough
>**__Note: This special campaign ops is only available when La Vaule (S) is under the control of San d'Oria.**__
* Head to {z:La Vaule (S)} after selecting the mission.
* Obtain a {k:Tigris stone} ({p:Key Item}).
** The stone drops off any of the Orcs in {z:La Vaule (S)} (excluding NMs).
** Every member of the party currently in the zone will receive a stone when it drops.
** However, only members with the Op flagged can enter the BCNM.
* The entrance to the battlefield is at the Reinforced Gateway at (F-9).
* Inside the battlefield, four NM's will spawn.
* {m:Darkheir Grradhod} ({p:SAM}) and his three helpers; {m:Gorepledge Rozzbrezz} ({p:PLD}), {m:Malicearm Razbhobb} ({p:MNK}), and {m:Slitherword Razghogg} ({p:BLM}).
** Only {m:Darkheir Grradhod} has to be defeated to win the fight.
*** {m:Darkheir Grradhod} can use {p:Meikyo Shisui}.
*** He has a unique {p:WS} called **Tornado Edge** which reduces {p:HP} by 50%, {p:MP} by 50% and reduces {p:TP} to 100%.
*** He has a very high {p:Counter} rate.
*** He is resistant to {s:Sleep} spells, however his helpers are not.
*** If Slitherword Razghogg is alive, Grradhod will have heavy magic resistence.
*** If Malicearm Razbhobb is alive, Grradhod will have a heavy Attack Bonus and will weaponskill with greater frequency.
*** If Gorepledge Rozzbrezz is alive, Grradhod will have a heavy Defense Bonus.
**** His helpers are much weaker, however they will respawn shortly after they are defeated.
**** The helpers share hate with {m:Darkheir Grradhod}.
* Once {m:Darkheir Grradhod} is defeated, an {p:Armoury Crate} will spawn.
* Return to {n:Rasdinice} to complete the mission.

